# Seeders + live schema on deploy

- New reference/catalog seeder → `scripts/run-deploy-seeds.sh` `run_one "…"`.
- New/changed schema → idempotent migration (`addColumnIfMissing` / `tableExists`). `scripts/ensure-live-migrations.js` must keep running on deploy (`remote-deploy-api.sh` + deploy seeds). Prod has skipped migrate / hit the wrong DB before.
- Pushing code is not enough. Do not rely on SSH ALTERs as the source of truth.
